---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Financial & Investment Risk Disclaimer"
  description="Comprehensive risk disclosures regarding cryptocurrency volatility, non-advisory status, and regulatory considerations."
  canonicalUrl="https://cryptopulse.news/disclaimer"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-700 text-xs font-bold mb-3">
        <span>⚠</span>
        <span>Important Legal & Regulatory Notice</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-black tracking-tight mb-3">
        Financial & Investment Risk Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">Strictly Enforced Across All Publications and Media</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-6 text-black shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-black mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide">Not Financial or Investment Advice</h2>
        <p class="text-black">The information provided on CryptoPulse—including articles, market metrics, tickers, price predictions, tokenomics breakdowns, and technical analysis—is published strictly for educational, news reporting, and general informational purposes. None of our content constitutes, or should be construed as, financial, investment, tax, legal, or accounting advice.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-4 shadow-xs">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-black">Extreme Capital Volatility & Loss Warning</h3>
        <p class="text-black">Cryptocurrencies, decentralized digital assets, smart contract protocols, and derivatives are speculative instruments subject to extraordinary market volatility, sudden regulatory interventions, protocol exploits, and liquidity depletion. You may lose the entirety of your invested capital. You should never commit capital you cannot afford to lose completely.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-4 shadow-xs">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-black">Independent Due Diligence Mandatory</h3>
        <p class="text-black">You are solely responsible for conducting your own rigorous technical and legal research ("Do Your Own Research - DYOR") and evaluating any digital asset project prior to executing trading transactions. Always consult licensed independent financial advisers registered in your legal jurisdiction before making monetary commitments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>